   "versionNonce": 1914012529,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "index": "a039",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "• win-rate conditioning on 100k random legal\n   teams: null (0.005–0.010 vs 0.008 unguided)\n• growing the top end of the dataset + retrain:\n   0.276 → 0.356 — the lever that works\n• plain retrain-on-own-samples: a slow random\n   sampler, stopped at generation 2\n• gradient guidance + elite-retrain loop: 0.262 →\n   0.411 by gen 10,\n   stopped on DIVERSITY (485 → 176 compositions),\n   never on win rate",
   "originalText": "• win-rate conditioning on 100k random legal\n   teams: null (0.005–0.010 vs 0.008 unguided)\n• growing the top end of the dataset + retrain:\n   0.276 → 0.356 — the lever that works\n• plain retrain-on-own-samples: a slow random\n   sampler, stopped at generation 2\n• gradient guidance + elite-retrain loop: 0.262 →\n   0.411 by gen 10,\n   stopped on DIVERSITY (485 → 176 compositions),\n   never on win rate",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
