   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "DONE 2026-10-04: got tracks\nasked up to 0.5 (got 0.32),\nflat to 0.7, drops above the\ntraining max. 'Best + 0.01'\nasks at 0.80 → got 0.21.\nStep from what you GOT.",
   "originalText": "DONE 2026-10-04: got tracks\nasked up to 0.5 (got 0.32),\nflat to 0.7, drops above the\ntraining max. 'Best + 0.01'\nasks at 0.80 → got 0.21.\nStep from what you GOT.",
