   "text": "MAP-Elites beat this loop by\n+0.084 [0.044, 0.123] but only\nmutates real teams. Use diffusion\nas its proposer: archive of\nniches, diffusion fills empty\ncells → many teams out (the\nproposer deliverable).",
   "originalText": "MAP-Elites beat this loop by\n+0.084 [0.044, 0.123] but only\nmutates real teams. Use diffusion\nas its proposer: archive of\nniches, diffusion fills empty\ncells → many teams out (the\nproposer deliverable).",
